^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
--
The other direction of lost_update_constant_size_array: two threads
increment the same element without a lock, a real lost update. The atomic
section added to element stores covers only the copy of the other elements,
not the program's own read of the element, so the violation is still found.
